    browser_session_rendering_spec_residual_failures_2026-08-19, 990, "2026-11-09 p3-browser sweep: left open - the 6 dom_input + 7 script_css_animation residuals are distinct defects (mid-word Draw-IR wrap of unbreakable words, default-action DOM stamping into serialized body, reset/blur composition, scripted cssText flush) overlapping the open input-path title bug; coordinate with the browser-session/JS lane before fixing."
    browser_session_rendering_spec_residual_failures_2026-08-19, 1113, "2026-11-13 UI batch B (linux aarch64, seed, release 35144b7f5e93): LIVE, measured. dom_input 19/25, script_css_animation 16/25. 1 failure is seed code-point slicing (title Case I-dot plus one extra char), 4 are spec references to helpers/fields that do not exist, 10 are engine behaviour in the JS-engine/browser lane; nothing skipped, stays open"
    browser_session_rendering_spec_residual_failures_2026-08-19, 1127, "2026-11-27 W6-1 partial fix & measured verdicts (wa3_shared_bin/simple.exe --mode=interpreter): browser_session_script_css_animation_spec.spl moved 16/25 -> 25/25 (0 failures, outcome=OK); browser_session_dom_input_spec.spl moved 20/25 -> 24/25 (1 failure). Fixed in-fence: omitted raw <script> text from render serialization in dom_accessors.spl; preserved initial CSS animation epoch_ms when advance_time runs before first render; added host_dom_mutation_dirty on JsInterpreter so generation wraparound to 0 still flushes to DOM; added _retire_dom_objects_except and adopt_host_body_bridge for post-innerHTML element identity without detached aliasing; blocked sandboxed button-activate/form-submit and skipped no-op _sync_runtime_body_from_dom in event dispatch; restored missing spec helpers and updated two Chrome-159 CSS test fixtures (appearance:none checkbox, #stage.blurred/#stage.focused specificity). Remaining 1 failure in dom_input_spec.spl is 'should parse mixed-case document tags through layout Draw IR and pixels' (seed UTF-8 codepoint slice 'Case I-dot<' plus out-of-fence simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout.spl text wrap owned by W5-5). Row stays open."
    browser_session_rendering_spec_residual_failures_2026-08-19, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep2-20261127: at tip BOTH named specs were import-blocked (0 examples) - six pre-existing val-level import cycles chained through their import graphs (backend_vulkan 3-way, js/engine runtime 2-way, browser_session 2-way, webgl_context 2-way; mostly from the 88aac2ffe28 main-to-release transplant; none from uncommitted wave-6 edits). Fixes: (1) broke all six cycles by moving shared constants into import-free leaf modules with export use facades - 30 Vulkan constants to backend_vulkan_font_types.spl, 230 NATIVE_* ids to new js/engine/runtime_ids.spl, MAX_SCRIPT_EXECUTION_STEPS + JS_HOST_DOM_MUTATION_MAX_* to js/engine/interpreter_types.spl, BROWSER_MAX_IMAGE_RESOURCES/PIXELS to new gc_async_mut/web/browser_session_limits.spl, 247 WEBGL_* to new gpu/browser_engine/webgl_constants.spl; (2) fixed the live dom_input title residual (expected Case I-with-dot-above to equal Case I): extract_title_text/extract_body_inner_html mixed byte-scanner indices with the codepoint html[a:b] slice (ADR-005) - switched to substring/.byte_len(); (3) fixed the documented mid-word wrap chop: the flat fallback _lay_compute_wrap_ranges_inner now takes the whole word on overflow (new _lay_flat_wrap_line_end mirroring the style path overflow-wrap:normal); web_wrap_line_end unit pins untouched. Specs: browser_session_html_title_units new 4/4, flat_wrap_overflow_word new 4/4; dom_input 24/25 - css_animation 25/25; vulkan_font_atlas_incremental_repack repaired (missing import closure + skip arity) 32+1skip OK. Residual matrix with evidence (build/p3cache/bsession/residual_matrix.md): script_css_animation all 7 doc residuals pre-fixed by W6-1 3f7fb9e83db (25/25 here); dom_input residual 1's remaining single failure (spec pins ONE Draw IR text command Visible I in a 24px box; the style-path layout emits 2 lines) is LIVE and fenced to W5-5 exactly as the 2026-11-27 addendum records - a layout-lane policy decision, not fixable by any width-aware wrap model here; browser_session_event_retention (per-dispatch growth unreclaimed - mechanism in files this lane never touched, reproduced under two seed binaries), simpleos_host_gpu_image_execution_contract (committed legacy stub), canvas_api 6 failures (committed 7a9e94aa50f float-format mismatch) all env/other-lane, red at tip before this lane. No new warnings attributable (the visibility-count rise is the previously masked full graph loading). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/lib/common/web/browser_session_html_title_units_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/flat_wrap_overflow_word_spec.spl"

